              "no": 21,
              "type": "INVOICE",
              "note": "\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION\n\nIf your car rental is in Orlando, upon arrival into Orlando Airport, once you exit the tram, please head to your right across the concourse and look for the large illuminated letter A on the wall in front of you.  Follow this and proceed to Terminal A Level one (Please note that terminal A and terminal B are on opposite sides of the concourse so ensure you only follow signs for A). Your Hertz Car will be waiting for you on the A Side of Orlando Airport.\n\n\n- Deposit:\nCredit Card: An authorisation amount of up to $200 will be added\nDebit Card:  An authorisation amount of up to $500 will be added. (Debit cards can only be used with car classes A-F)\n",
