                      "no": 1,
                      "type": "BOOKING",
                      "note": "****USA RESORT TEAM CONTACT DETAILS****\n\nOur highly trained Resort Experts are always on hand to answer any questions you may have. If you encounter any problems or have a complaint, please let us know straight away so we can do our best to resolve things for you.\n\nContact us:\n\nFlorida \u0026 East Coast USA Cities\nPhone: \u002B1 407 856 1177\nWhatsApp: \u002B44 7360544350\nEmail: sanitized\u002Bcb65b8ab@example.com\n8am-8pm EST Mon-Sun\n\nCalls, WhatsApp\u0027s and Emails will be answered during these opening times.\nPlease check with your phone company for costs of calling abroad.\n\nFlorida Virgin Atlantic Holidays Office:\nMarriott Village Service Centre \n8623 Vineland Ave Orlando FL 32821\n8am-4pm EST Mon-Fri\n \n24 hour UK Emergency Support Line: \u002B44 344 472 4920 or sanitized\u002B9cc062bc@example.com\n\nThis number is for out of hours emergencies where you are unable to reach our Resort Team and need urgent help, such as if there was an accident or illness, missed flight connections, or problems checking in for your flight/accommodation.\n\nPlease print and keep this contact card with your travel documents.",
