      "notes": [
        {
          "no": 0,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "****WEB CHAT****\n\nAdded car hire \n\nadditional cost \u00A3653.30\n\nNew total holiday cost \u00A37879.81\n\n1:13:52 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\n.\n1:22:11 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nThank you for contacting Virgin Atlantic Holidays, you\u2019re speaking to Wendy, how can I help today\n1:31:11 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nWould it be possible to add car hire to my holiday?\n\nIt was not an option to add when I booked\n1:33:59 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nI am more than. happy to look into this for you, but before I do, I just need you to answer some questions for me please, Can you confirm you are the  lead passenger on the booking, Your full name, date of birth, First line of address, postcode, and  the email address, and your booking reference?\n1:34:54 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nYes I am, martina tapscott, 17/12/80, 16 Hillcrest, Ng34 8eq, sanitized\u002B6971778a@example.com\n\n6996566\n1:36:02 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nMany thanks for confirming :) Would you like the car for the full duration, picking up and dropping it off at the airport?\n1:36:59 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nYes please\n\nCould it be a suv\n1:37:17 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nwas there a particular vehicle you was looking for or a SUV?\n1:37:45 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nEither escape or explorer suv please\n1:38:29 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nSure, Bare with me, i will have a look\n1:38:52 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nSorry to keep you, the system is slow\n1:43:12 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nThat\u2019s ok\n1:43:24 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nThe Escape or similar is \u00A3421 for the Hertz go insurance, Hertz go plus is \u00A3623 and the Hertz Go premier is \u00A3654 . I am just going to check the Explorer for you All prices are subject to change / availability\n\nThe Explorer or similar is \u00A3905 for the Hertz Go, \u00A31108 Hertz go plus and \u00A31139 for the Hertz Go Premier\n1:47:50 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nCan I go for the escape hertz go premier\n1:48:32 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nSure, lt me get that one added for you\n\nThe Escape or similar is \u00A3654 for the Hertz Go Premier, would you ike to go ahead ?\n1:50:12 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nYes please\n1:50:30 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nPerfect, let me get that done for you :)\n\nWho would be the lead driver please\n1:51:32 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nElliot tapscott\n1:51:47 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nThank you\n1:51:58 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nThat\u0027s all added for you, and \u00A3653.30 added to your balance. Was there anything else i can help with today\n1:55:24 PM\n\nPa\nParticipant\n\nContext menu\nNo that\u2019s all. Thank you, you\u2019ve been amazing! Have a nice day.\n1:55:54 PM\n\nWM\nWendy A Matthes\n\nContext menu\nWhy thank you! Have a great day :)",
